      "flags": {},
      "order": 3,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Download Custom Node Pack\n- Download MC_PBR_Master node pack at [Github](https://github.com/soojungkn/mc-pbr-master)\n\n## Note\n- This workflow requires MicroCreativity's custom node pack, MC_PBR_Master.\n- Custom nodes are currently unavailable on Comfy Cloud.\n- AI Image Upscale node might not be able to use GPU accelaration depending on your cuda version. (currently supports 12.x version only)\n\n## Model links (for AI Image Upscale Node)\n- Download \"model.onnx\" from each link, and rename the files to each model name.\n\n**swin2SR models**\n\n- [swin2SR-classical-sr-x4-64](https://huggingface.co/Xenova/swin2SR-classical-sr-x4-64/tree/main/onnx)\n- [swin2SR-realworld-sr-x4](https://huggingface.co/Xenova/swin2SR-realworld-sr-x4-64-bsrgan-psnr/tree/main/onnx)\n- [swin2SR-lightweight-x2-64](https://huggingface.co/Xenova/swin2SR-lightweight-x2-64/tree/main/onnx)\n\n\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n      └── 📂 upscale_models/\n             ├── swin2SR-classical-sr-x4-64.onnx\n             ├── swin2SR-realworld-sr-x4.onnx\n             └── swin2SR-lightweight-x2-64.onnx\n\n```\n\n## Report issue\nPlease report technical issues to support@microcreativity.xyz\n\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
